# Packages of the live medium.
#
# The installer itself is Python + Tk, so the medium needs an X server for one
# application and nothing else: no desktop, no browser, no window manager.
# Everything else here is what the installation engine calls: pacstrap, the
# partitioning tools, mkfs for each supported filesystem and the network.

# --- base system and kernel -------------------------------------------------
base
linux
linux-firmware
intel-ucode
amd-ucode
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
systemd-sysvcompat
sudo
nano
vim
less
man-db
man-pages
bash-completion
tmux
htop
zsh

# --- the installer ----------------------------------------------------------
python
tk
xorg-server
xorg-xinit
xorg-xset
xorg-xsetroot
xf86-input-libinput
xf86-video-vesa
xf86-video-intel
xf86-video-amdgpu
mesa
ttf-dejavu
noto-fonts
adwaita-cursors

